e": 17, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25, "baseline": 15}, {"id": "e20", "type": "text", "x": 12, "y": 266, "width": 392.70000000000005, "height": 227.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 884585952, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2132084005, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "- record 20 s voice Note per Machine\n- review draft side by side, edit, confirm, approve\n- assign Workers to Machines per shift\n- board: Locks, flags, open Confusions\n- acknowledge Confusions\n- Skill Matrix, Confusion Heatmap\n- manage Glossary Terms\n- record Briefing, read receipts\n- read Near-miss Reports\n- Knowledge Library + diff\n- print QR stickers\n- pair Workers with Senpai\n- download Support Log CSV", "originalText": "- record 20 s voice Note per Machine\n- review draft side by side, edit, confirm, approve\n- assign Workers to Machines per shift\n- board: Locks, flags, open Confusions\n- acknowledge Confusions\n- Skill Matrix, Confusion Heatmap\n- manage Glossary Terms\n- record Briefing, read receipts\n- read Near-miss Reports\n- Knowledge Library + diff\n- print QR stickers\n- pair Workers with Senpai\n- download Support Log CSV", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25, "baseline": 12}, {"id": "e21", "type": "rectangle", "x": 390, "y": 230, "width": 370, "height": 258.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1836494975, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1349251824, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e22", "type": "text", "x": 402, "y": 238, "width": 271.15000000000003, "height": 21.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1999744785, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1946412081, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Worker (no login, picks name)", "originalText": "Worker (no login, picks name)", "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25, "baseline": 15}, {"id": "e23", "type": "text", "x": 402, "y": 266, "width": 346.50000000000006, "height": 210.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1552984409, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1287489454, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "WORK\n- scan QR, read Note (JA/BN/EN, icons, audio)\n- take Check, get Sign-off\n- Skill Passport\n- open Briefing + Check\n- file Near-miss Report (voice + photo)\nLIFE\n- Notice feed, today/tomorrow Events\n- Notice Check, add to calendar (.ics)\n- Ask (text or voice), grounded answer\n- forward Ask to Senpai\n- log Meet-up", "originalText": "WORK\n- scan QR, read Note (JA/BN/EN, icons, audio)\n- take Check, get Sign-off\n- Skill Passport\n- open Briefing + Check\n- file Near-miss Report (voice + photo)\nLIFE\n- Notice feed, today/tomorrow Events\n- Notice Check, add to calendar (.ics)\n- Ask (text or voice), grounded answer\n- forward Ask to Senpai\n- log Meet-up", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25, "baseline": 12}, {"id": "e24", "type": "rectangle", "x": 780, "y": 230, "width": 370, "height": 153.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1066984056, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 772092315, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e25", "type": "text", "x": 792, "y": 238, "width": 299.20000000000005, "height": 21.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1048386556, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 351564608, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Community Poster (COMMUNITY_PIN)", "originalText": "Community Poster (COMMUNITY_PIN)", "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25, "baseline": 15}, {"id": "e26", "type": "text", "x": 792, "y": 266, "width": 300.30000000000007, "height": 105.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1289560150, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2126508551, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "- post Notice: text, voice, flyer photo\n- review steps next to source flyer\n- confirm each Event (next 3 dates)\n- publish Notice\n- see reach: opened / understood / not\n- NEVER sees shop data (403)", "originalText": "- post Notice: text, v